From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 16:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: remove spurious vsock_socket allow rule from camera HAL domain

The camera HAL (hal_camera_default) does not use AF_VSOCK. The
'allow hal_camera_default self:{ socket vsock_socket } ...' rule was
copied in erroneously and now causes a build-time neverallow violation
with the 'neverallow { domain -unconstrained_vsock_violators }
*:vsock_socket ...' rule in system/sepolicy/private/domain.te.

Remove the rule from both camera-ext variants (ext-camera-only and ivi).
No functional change — the camera HAL never opened vsock sockets.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1182
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 camera-ext/ext-camera-only/hal_camera_default.te | 1 -
 camera-ext/ivi/hal_camera_default.te             | 1 -
 2 files changed, 2 deletions(-)
diff --git a/camera-ext/ext-camera-only/hal_camera_default.te b/camera-ext/ext-camera-only/hal_camera_default.te
index 67ca30f..fa5901a 100644
--- a/camera-ext/ext-camera-only/hal_camera_default.te
+++ b/camera-ext/ext-camera-only/hal_camera_default.te
@@ -8,7 +8,6 @@ allow hal_camera_default gpu_device:dir search;
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_allocator_default_tmpfs:file { map read write };
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_mapper_hwservice:hwservice_manager find;
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_composer_default:fd use;
-allow hal_camera_default self:{ socket vsock_socket } { create read write listen accept bind };
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_mapper_service:service_manager find;
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_allocator_default:binder call;
 set_prop(hal_camera_default, vendor_camera_default_prop)
diff --git a/camera-ext/ivi/hal_camera_default.te b/camera-ext/ivi/hal_camera_default.te
index c28c02c..d2afb4b 100644
--- a/camera-ext/ivi/hal_camera_default.te
+++ b/camera-ext/ivi/hal_camera_default.te
@@ -12,6 +12,5 @@ allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_allocator_service:service_manager find;
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_allocator_default_tmpfs:file { map read write };
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_mapper_hwservice:hwservice_manager find;
 allow hal_camera_default hal_graphics_composer_default:fd use;
-allow hal_camera_default self:{ socket vsock_socket } { create read write listen accept bind };
 set_prop(hal_camera_default, vendor_camera_default_prop)
 hal_client_domain(hal_camera_default, hal_graphics_allocator)

